    {
      "id": "W7211936759",
      "doi": "10.1364/oe.611598",
      "title": "Secret key rate enhancement through joint precoding and power loading for downstream CV-QKD over passive optical networks",
      "authors": [
        "Yuan Liu",
        "Calvin C. K. Chan"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Express",
      "venue_abbr": "OE",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "continuous-variable quantum key distribution",
        "passive optical networks",
        "secret key rate",
        "downstream transmission"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.611598",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/ba5632d3-e519-471f-baf7-b36e2da1aa27.html",
      "summary": "该研究针对无源光网络中各光网络单元信道条件不同、且共享总发射功率预算与预编码矩阵的问题，提出联合优化酉预编码矩阵和功率分配的时域方案，利用噪声频谱非平坦性提升平均秘密密钥率。数值仿真表明，在20 km、64个光网络单元的配置下，相比传统未优化系统，密钥率提升至2.52—4.57倍；相比采用DFT预编码并优化功率加载的系统，提升至1.02—1.90倍。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
